      "id": "claim_fe0aa68ca0ea44baa37b7e3c794187db",
      "statement": "utils/cautils/acme_flow.go exposes ACMECreateCertFlow (subject, certFile, keyFile args plus --san; builds the flow with withSubjectSANs and withProvisionerName, calls GetCertificate, writes the PEM chain with writeCert, and serializes the private key unless it is a TPM/attestation key) and ACMESignCSRFlow (same transaction using a caller-provided CSR via withCSR, writing only the certificate file).",
