      "statement": "HTTP-01 challenge serving has two modes behind the issueMode interface: standaloneMode starts an HTTP server on --http-listen (default :80) serving /.well-known/acme-challenge/<token> with the key authorization and shuts it down on cleanup; webrootMode writes the key authorization to <webroot>/.well-known/acme-challenge/<token> (0755 dir, 0644 file) served by an existing webserver and removes it on cleanup.",
